  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n17 × 684 ÷ 57 − (5/7) × 4.2 = x + 13 × 204 ÷ 17\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nBODMAS rule\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 17 × 684 ÷ 57 = 17 × 12 = 204\n\n⇒ (5 ÷ 7) × 4.2 = (5 ÷ 7) × (42 ÷ 10) = 210 ÷ 70 = 3\n\n⇒ LHS = 204 − 3 = 201\n\n⇒ 13 × 204 ÷ 17 = 13 × 12 = 156\n\n⇒ 201 = x + 156\n\n⇒ x = 201 − 156\n\n⇒ x = 45\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 45.**",
